Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:05:21.50,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 女单1/4决赛
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:05:21.50,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}莱巴金娜 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}1 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 郑钦文 · 赛后新闻发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.43,0:00:03.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.43,0:00:03.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,有记者提问吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.62,EN,,0,0,0,,Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,请这位记者提问。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:05.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Hey there, sorry about the loss,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:05.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,很遗憾你今天输掉了比赛，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.94,0:00:07.02,EN,,0,0,0,,but it's been a remarkable run
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.94,0:00:07.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,但这次征程非常出色，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:09.64,EN,,0,0,0,,from qualifiers to the quarter final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:09.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,从资格赛一路打进八强。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:10.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Just can you kind of reflect
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:10.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,能否请你回顾一下？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.38,0:00:11.80,EN,,0,0,0,,upon just how maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.38,0:00:11.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,从当时到现在，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:12.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I know it's a little bit tough to think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:12.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道刚输球，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:13.66,EN,,0,0,0,,about now, but how proud are you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:13.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,很难去想，但你有多自豪？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:16.72,EN,,0,0,0,,of the run, given that big reset you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:16.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,从在佛罗里达重新调整，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:20.46,EN,,0,0,0,,had in Florida to where you are now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:20.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后才一路走到了今天。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:25.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I think the win that I had so far for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:25.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我认为此前取得的那些胜利，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:28.36,EN,,0,0,0,,is great, but obviously today in the match,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:28.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然很棒。但今天这场比赛，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:30.30,EN,,0,0,0,,I had got a lot of chance in the third set,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:30.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在决胜盘有很多机会，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:31.86,EN,,0,0,0,,but I didn't took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:31.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,却没有把握住。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.86,0:00:35.32,EN,,0,0,0,,It was a bit pity for me to lose this match,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.86,0:00:35.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,输掉这场比赛，有些遗憾。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:37.44,EN,,0,0,0,,but obviously I could take positive things
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:37.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我也能从中有所收获，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:38.28,EN,,0,0,0,,from U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:38.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,从今年这次美网之旅中，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.28,0:00:41.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Open this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.28,0:00:41.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,带走这些收获。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:44.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Despite the loss,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:44.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,虽然今天输了，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:46.86,EN,,0,0,0,,what do you think was the key today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:46.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得今天的关键是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.86,0:00:49.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to what you could have done to win?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.86,0:00:49.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,怎样做，才有机会赢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.64,0:00:51.82,EN,,0,0,0,,What do you think you could have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.64,0:00:51.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得自己还能做些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.82,0:00:55.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, obviously I think that passing shot I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.82,0:00:55.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得，那个穿越球，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:58.26,EN,,0,0,0,,missed makes some difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:58.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,没打进，确实影响了结果。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.26,0:01:00.32,EN,,0,0,0,,And of course, I think maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.26,0:01:00.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然，我也觉得，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:03.02,EN,,0,0,0,,when she serves second serve,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:03.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,面对她的二发时，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.02,0:01:04.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I could be more aggressive sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.02,0:01:04.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,有些时候我可以更主动，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.76,0:01:07.26,EN,,0,0,0,,and make a bit less mistake in the return
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.76,0:01:07.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,接发球也能再少些失误。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:09.62,EN,,0,0,0,,because when the rally gets long,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:09.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为回合一旦拉长，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.62,0:01:12.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I think it's where I get more points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.62,0:01:12.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得自己就更容易得分。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:15.38,EN,,0,0,0,,So I mean, today's just few points makes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:15.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以，今天就是几个关键分，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:18.54,EN,,0,0,0,,a difference and that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:18.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,决定了胜负。就是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.54,0:01:21.02,EN,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.54,0:01:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有更多想说的了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.02,0:01:23.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on a nice run, Qinwen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.02,0:01:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,钦文，祝贺你这次的表现。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.36,0:01:25.42,EN,,0,0,0,,How does your mindset, as you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.36,0:01:25.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,想问一下你的心态。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.42,0:01:26.82,EN,,0,0,0,,I know it's right after the match,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.42,0:01:26.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道比赛才刚结束，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.82,0:01:29.26,EN,,0,0,0,,but looking towards the end of the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.82,0:01:29.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,但展望今年接下来的赛程，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.26,0:01:30.28,EN,,0,0,0,,the rest of the tournaments to play,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.26,0:01:30.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有那些待打的比赛，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:32.04,EN,,0,0,0,,how different does your
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:32.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的心态有多大变化？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.04,0:01:33.86,EN,,0,0,0,,mindset feel now maybe compared
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.04,0:01:33.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在的感受，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:36.18,EN,,0,0,0,,to earlier this year in spring when you were
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:36.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,比起今年春天，当时你觉得，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.18,0:01:38.16,EN,,0,0,0,,feeling like you couldn't get any rhythm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.18,0:01:38.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己始终找不到节奏，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:42.38,EN,,0,0,0,,or really have a chance to fight in matches?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:42.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,也很难在比赛中展开争夺。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:45.54,EN,,0,0,0,,I think the good thing is I know how
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:45.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,好的一点是，现在我知道，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.54,0:01:46.52,EN,,0,0,0,,to compete better
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.54,0:01:46.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,怎样更好地投入竞争，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:48.34,EN,,0,0,0,,than before, than in the beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:48.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,比此前、比年初，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:49.00,EN,,0,0,0,,of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:49.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,都做得更好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:49.88,EN,,0,0,0,,In the beginning of the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,年初的时候，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:53.82,EN,,0,0,0,,I was a bit totally out of tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:53.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,我有点完全脱离了比赛状态，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.82,0:01:56.18,EN,,0,0,0,,like rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.82,0:01:56.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,找不到比赛节奏。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.18,0:01:58.88,EN,,0,0,0,,And obviously this tournament helps me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.18,0:01:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,这次赛事显然帮助了我，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.88,0:02:02.32,EN,,0,0,0,,to find myself little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.88,0:02:02.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我一点点找回自己。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:04.92,EN,,0,0,0,,And in the match just today,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:04.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,至于今天这场比赛，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.42,EN,,0,0,0,,I think there's a lot to learn when I lost
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,输了，也有很多值得学习。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:09.28,EN,,0,0,0,,because there are some decisions
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:09.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为有些决策，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:10.64,EN,,0,0,0,,in the important moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:10.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,是在关键时刻做出的，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:13.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I wasn't doing right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:13.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,而我当时没有做好。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.16,0:02:15.78,EN,,0,0,0,,And that was also a very physical match
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.16,0:02:15.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场比赛对体能的要求，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.78,0:02:16.44,EN,,0,0,0,,for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.78,0:02:16.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说也很高。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.44,0:02:18.34,EN,,0,0,0,,She got a great serve
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.44,0:02:18.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,她的发球很出色，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:20.02,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think I have to be really focused
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:20.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我必须高度集中，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.02,0:02:23.00,EN,,0,0,0,,to return every single time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.02,0:02:23.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,认真应对每一次接发球。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:23.80,EN,,0,0,0,,In general,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:23.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,总的来说，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.80,0:02:25.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I could take some positive things
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.80,0:02:25.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我能带走一些积极的收获。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.84,0:02:28.30,EN,,0,0,0,,and the rest I could go back
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.84,0:02:28.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,其余的，我可以回去总结，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:31.82,EN,,0,0,0,,and to do what I can do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:31.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,看看哪些地方能做得更好。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.82,0:02:34.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.82,0:02:34.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝贺你这次的表现。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.52,0:02:36.62,EN,,0,0,0,,What will you carry forward expanding
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.52,0:02:36.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,接着刚才问的，哪些收获，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:38.60,EN,,0,0,0,,on Eva's question throughout the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:38.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会带到接下来的比赛中，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:40.20,EN,,0,0,0,,of the year and the next year,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:40.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,延续到今年余下赛季和明年？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:41.32,EN,,0,0,0,,especially having
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:41.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是经历了，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.32,0:02:42.94,EN,,0,0,0,,these great comeback wins
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.32,0:02:42.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,这些精彩的逆转，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.94,0:02:47.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and those 5–0 down sets?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.94,0:02:47.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,包括盘中0比5落后后的翻盘。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:50.66,EN,,0,0,0,,I think tennis also gives me a lesson all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:50.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得，网球一直在教会我，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.66,0:02:54.10,EN,,0,0,0,,the time that as soon as the match
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.66,0:02:54.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,只要比赛，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.10,0:02:56.92,EN,,0,0,0,,is not over, you just have to keep fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.10,0:02:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,还没有结束，就要继续战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:58.46,EN,,0,0,0,,because you never know what can happen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:58.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你不知道会发生什么，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:00.50,EN,,0,0,0,,in one tennis game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:00.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,网球比赛里，一切皆有可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.50,0:03:03.74,EN,,0,0,0,,And second things is I think there's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.50,0:03:03.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二点是，我觉得自己，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:04.62,EN,,0,0,0,,so much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:04.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有很多、很多，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:06.46,EN,,0,0,0,,I still have on myself to improve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:06.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,可以提升的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.46,0:03:09.20,EN,,0,0,0,,So that's the positive things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.46,0:03:09.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,这也是积极的一面。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.20,0:03:12.52,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, no more I can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.20,0:03:12.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有更多要说的了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:15.14,EN,,0,0,0,,We know how you're different tennis -wise
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:15.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们知道，你在网球方面，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.14,0:03:17.22,EN,,0,0,0,,from a year or two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.14,0:03:17.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,和一两年前已经有所不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:21.72,EN,,0,0,0,,How are you different personality -wise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:21.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,那你的性格发生了哪些变化？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.72,0:03:26.34,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I would say deep inside me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.72,0:03:26.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想说，在内心深处，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:29.62,EN,,0,0,0,,I haven't changed that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:29.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,我并没有改变太多。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:33.48,EN,,0,0,0,,The things is after an injury
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:33.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是受伤之后，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:36.00,EN,,0,0,0,,because I'm not doing so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:36.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为自己的表现不太好，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.00,0:03:39.22,EN,,0,0,0,,So I try to learn like a bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.00,0:03:39.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我试着学着，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:42.94,EN,,0,0,0,,hide a bit my character to don't show
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:42.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,把自己的个性稍微收起来，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.94,0:03:44.78,EN,,0,0,0,,that much because you know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.94,0:03:44.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,不要展露太多。你也知道，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.78,0:03:46.32,EN,,0,0,0,,when you don't have a good result,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.78,0:03:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,当你没有好成绩的时候，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.32,0:03:47.60,EN,,0,0,0,,people just judge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.32,0:03:47.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,人们就会评判你。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:49.66,EN,,0,0,0,,But I'm just the same person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:49.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我还是同一个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.66,0:03:52.08,EN,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if I win or if I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.66,0:03:52.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,无论赢球还是输球，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:03:53.58,EN,,0,0,0,,I think the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:03:53.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的想法都一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:56.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I think it's important to be a good person
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我认为，做一个好人很重要，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.28,0:03:59.98,EN,,0,0,0,,and then stay humble in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.28,0:03:59.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,在生活中保持谦逊也很重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.98,0:04:02.34,EN,,0,0,0,,But sometimes people just don't like
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.98,0:04:02.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,但有时，人们就是不喜欢，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:03.86,EN,,0,0,0,,when you speak the reality
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:03.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,你说实话。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:06.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and when you like,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:06.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:08.22,EN,,0,0,0,,they like more when you speak fake stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:08.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们反而更喜欢听假话。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:10.02,EN,,0,0,0,,but that's not how I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:10.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,可我不是那样的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.02,0:04:12.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I would say I become better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.02,0:04:12.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想说，我变得更好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:15.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm more open compared to two,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我现在更开放了，相比于，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:15.76,EN,,0,0,0,,three years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:15.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,两三年前的自己。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:18.44,EN,,0,0,0,,but the base has never changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:18.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,但根本的东西从未改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:20.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm still myself, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:20.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还是我自己。对。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:22.62,EN,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:22.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:23.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:23.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝贺你。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:24.74,EN,,0,0,0,,You'll get a chance to probably play
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:24.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,接下来你应该有机会，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:25.92,EN,,0,0,0,,at home in the next few months
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:25.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,在未来几个月回到主场比赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:27.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and just how relieved maybe excited
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:27.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,你有多安心，又有多兴奋？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:28.20,EN,,0,0,0,,are you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:28.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,对于这个机会，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:29.96,EN,,0,0,0,,to have that opportunity now having taken
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:29.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,能带着这次比赛的势头，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.42,EN,,0,0,0,,this momentum from this tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,回到主场，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:34.52,EN,,0,0,0,,hopefully into the fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:34.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,并希望延续到秋季赛程？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:37.86,EN,,0,0,0,,I always, I'm so excited to play in China
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:37.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直很期待在中国比赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:42.20,EN,,0,0,0,,especially coming from qualifying US Open
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:42.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其从美网资格赛出发，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:43.76,EN,,0,0,0,,and then reach until here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:43.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后一路打到这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:47.44,EN,,0,0,0,,that was a really, really difficult journey
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这段旅程非常、非常艰难，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.44,0:04:49.84,EN,,0,0,0,,for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.44,0:04:49.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说确实如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.84,0:04:52.58,EN,,0,0,0,,Of course, playing at home always,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.84,0:04:52.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然，回到主场比赛，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:54.26,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm more motivated and also
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:54.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,我总会更有动力，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:56.32,EN,,0,0,0,,in the same time, carry out some pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:56.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,同时也会承受一些压力，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:58.74,EN,,0,0,0,,because I really wants to do it well there
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:58.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我真的很想在那里打好。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.74,0:05:02.38,EN,,0,0,0,,but I just want to say, keep calm
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.74,0:05:02.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我想对自己说：保持冷静，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:05.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and just training day by day, focus
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:05.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,一天一天地训练，专注，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:10.62,EN,,0,0,0,,in the match by match, focus on the present
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:10.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,一场一场地打，专注当下。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:12.74,EN,,0,0,0,,because when your mind's trying
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:12.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为当你的思绪，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.74,0:05:14.38,EN,,0,0,0,,to go everywhere, thinking too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.74,0:05:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,到处飘、想得太多时，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:16.58,EN,,0,0,0,,that's not helping for tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:16.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,对打网球是没有帮助的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:17.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Last question. That was my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后一问。那就是我的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.80,EN,,0,0,0,,That was your question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,那就是你的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:20.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:20.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢。
